<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [379].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>379&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CARNOBACTERIUM PLEISTOCAENIUM MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
